# Every .env variant, allowlisting only the committed templates.
#
# This was previously just `.env`, which matches ONLY a file named exactly `.env` —
# a `.env.prod` or `.env.staging` would have been committed on the next `git add -A`.
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.prod.example
staticfiles/
*.sqlite3
.DS_Store
.pytest_cache/
